<title>INDIA: India Ponds 1997 1st half net sales.</title>
<headline>India Ponds 1997 1st half net sales.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unilever  subsidiary and cosmetics maker Ponds India Ltd said on Wednesday its net sales in the first half of 1997 had risen to 2.20 billion rupees from 1.82 billion in the corresponding period last year.</p>
<p>--Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
